    hasSFX: 1
    soundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f300f6f637051434a99e353b8ee75b79, type: 3}
    _line: "It\u2019s just, I never got how the food workers here are safe. You\u2019re
      making a bunch of food with hot machines in little tents."
    _speakerProperties:
    - _speakerType: 2
      _name: 
